WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.667
Here's one,

00:00:08.667 --> 00:00:10.300
a picture puzzle!

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.000
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:13.533
A.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:15.167
A filled square,

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:15.700
B.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.333
An empty square,

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:17.867
C.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:19.500
A filled triangle,

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.567
or D.

00:00:20.567 --> 00:00:22.200
A filled circle?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.267
Five seconds!

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:30.267
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:32.067
The answer is...

00:00:32.067 --> 00:00:32.467
A,

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:33.600
a filled square!

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.867
The rule is the shape gets

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:38.167
filled in but stays the same

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:38.533
shape,

00:00:38.533 --> 00:00:40.800
so the empty square becomes a

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.567
filled square.

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:43.467
Alright,

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.700
a word analogy!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.667
Shoe is to foot,

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.600
as hat is to...

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.367
what?

00:00:52.367 --> 00:00:53.100
A.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:53.833
Head,

00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:54.567
B.

00:00:54.567 --> 00:00:55.300
Hair,

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:56.067
C.

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:56.800
Neck,

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:58.267
or D.

00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.000
Glove?

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.500
Five seconds!

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:07.467
TIME'S UP!

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:08.533
It's...

00:01:08.533 --> 00:01:08.933
A,

00:01:08.933 --> 00:01:09.333
head!

00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:11.733
A shoe goes on a foot,

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:14.133
so a hat goes on a

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:14.533
head.

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.933
It is the body part each

00:01:16.933 --> 00:01:17.733
one covers.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:19.500
Okay,

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.267
a number series!

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:21.867
Eighty,

00:01:21.867 --> 00:01:22.433
forty,

00:01:22.433 --> 00:01:23.033
twenty,

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:23.633
ten,

00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:24.800
and then...

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.567
what comes next?

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:27.167
A.

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:27.767
Five,

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:28.333
B.

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:28.933
Eight,

00:01:28.933 --> 00:01:29.533
C.

00:01:29.533 --> 00:01:30.100
Fifteen,

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:31.300
or D.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:31.867
Six?

00:01:31.867 --> 00:01:33.067
Five seconds!

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:40.033
TIME'S UP!

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.233
The answer is...

00:01:42.233 --> 00:01:42.767
A,

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:43.267
five!

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:46.367
Each number is cut in half:

00:01:46.367 --> 00:01:46.867
eighty,

00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:47.400
forty,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:47.900
twenty,

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:48.400
ten,

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.500
so half of ten is five.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:53.233
Okay,

00:01:53.233 --> 00:01:54.933
a picture puzzle!

00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:58.333
Where does the dot move next?

00:01:58.333 --> 00:01:58.900
A.

00:01:58.900 --> 00:01:59.467
Top-right,

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:00.033
B.

00:02:00.033 --> 00:02:00.600
Bottom-left,

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:01.167
C.

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:01.733
Center,

00:02:01.733 --> 00:02:02.900
or D.

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:03.467
Top-left?

00:02:03.467 --> 00:02:04.600
Five seconds!

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:11.567
TIME'S UP!

00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:13.867
The answer is...

00:02:13.867 --> 00:02:14.433
A,

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:14.967
top-right!

00:02:14.967 --> 00:02:17.167
The dot steps counter-clockwise

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:18.800
corner to corner:

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:19.367
top-left,

00:02:19.367 --> 00:02:19.900
bottom-left,

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:20.467
bottom-right,

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:23.767
so the next corner is top-right.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:25.500
Alright!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:28.600
Which one does NOT belong?

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.200
A.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:29.833
Square,

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:30.433
B.

00:02:30.433 --> 00:02:31.067
Triangle,

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:31.667
C.

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:32.300
Circle,

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.533
or D.

00:02:33.533 --> 00:02:34.133
Cube?

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.367
Five seconds!

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:42.367
TIME'S UP!

00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:43.500
It's...

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:43.933
D,

00:02:43.933 --> 00:02:44.400
cube!

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.300
A square,

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:45.767
triangle,

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:48.500
and circle are all flat shapes.

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.233
A cube is a solid shape

00:02:51.233 --> 00:02:52.600
you can hold,

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.867
so it does not belong.

00:02:56.033 --> 00:02:57.233
Here's one,

00:02:57.233 --> 00:02:59.033
a number series!

00:02:59.033 --> 00:02:59.633
One,

00:02:59.633 --> 00:03:00.233
four,

00:03:00.233 --> 00:03:00.833
five,

00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:01.433
nine,

00:03:01.433 --> 00:03:02.033
fourteen,

00:03:02.033 --> 00:03:03.233
and then...

00:03:03.233 --> 00:03:05.033
what comes next?

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:05.633
A.

00:03:05.633 --> 00:03:06.233
Nineteen,

00:03:06.233 --> 00:03:06.833
B.

00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:07.433
Twenty-eight,

00:03:07.433 --> 00:03:08.033
C.

00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:08.633
Twenty-three,

00:03:08.633 --> 00:03:09.833
or D.

00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:10.433
Twenty?

00:03:10.433 --> 00:03:11.633
Five seconds!

00:03:17.433 --> 00:03:18.633
TIME'S UP!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.633
The answer is...

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:21.067
C,

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:21.500
twenty-three!

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.133
Add the two numbers before it:

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:26.333
nine plus fourteen is twenty-three.

00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:28.967
Each number is the sum of

00:03:28.967 --> 00:03:30.733
the two before it.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:33.000
Here's one,

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.667
a shape puzzle!

00:03:34.667 --> 00:03:36.867
Which shape comes next?

00:03:36.867 --> 00:03:37.433
A.

00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:38.533
A circle,

00:03:38.533 --> 00:03:39.100
B.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.200
A square,

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:40.767
C.

00:03:40.767 --> 00:03:41.867
A triangle,

00:03:41.867 --> 00:03:42.967
or D.

00:03:42.967 --> 00:03:44.067
A pentagon?

00:03:44.067 --> 00:03:45.167
Five seconds!

00:03:50.967 --> 00:03:52.167
TIME'S UP!

00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:54.333
The answer is...

00:03:54.333 --> 00:03:54.833
B,

00:03:54.833 --> 00:03:55.833
a square!

00:03:55.833 --> 00:03:58.867
The sides count down by one:

00:03:58.867 --> 00:03:59.867
heptagon seven,

00:03:59.867 --> 00:04:00.867
hexagon six,

00:04:00.867 --> 00:04:01.867
pentagon five,

00:04:01.867 --> 00:04:04.867
so next is the square with

00:04:04.867 --> 00:04:05.867
four sides.

00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:07.633
Alright,

00:04:07.633 --> 00:04:09.467
a number analogy!

00:04:09.467 --> 00:04:11.267
One makes four,

00:04:11.267 --> 00:04:13.100
two makes six,

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.900
three makes eight,

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.733
so four makes...

00:04:16.733 --> 00:04:17.333
what?

00:04:17.333 --> 00:04:17.933
A.

00:04:17.933 --> 00:04:18.533
Nine,

00:04:18.533 --> 00:04:19.133
B.

00:04:19.133 --> 00:04:19.767
Ten,

00:04:19.767 --> 00:04:20.367
C.

00:04:20.367 --> 00:04:20.967
Eleven,

00:04:20.967 --> 00:04:22.167
or D.

00:04:22.167 --> 00:04:22.767
Twelve?

00:04:22.767 --> 00:04:24.000
Five seconds!

00:04:29.767 --> 00:04:30.967
TIME'S UP!

00:04:31.633 --> 00:04:32.100
It's...

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:32.567
B,

00:04:32.567 --> 00:04:33.033
ten!

00:04:33.033 --> 00:04:35.867
Each number is doubled then add

00:04:35.867 --> 00:04:36.333
two:

00:04:36.333 --> 00:04:38.700
four times two is eight,

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:40.600
plus two is ten.

00:04:41.733 --> 00:04:43.167
Check this out,

00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:45.100
fill in the blank!

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.967
The hikers felt so blank after

00:04:47.967 --> 00:04:50.867
climbing all day that they stopped

00:04:50.867 --> 00:04:53.267
to rest beside the trail.

00:04:53.267 --> 00:04:53.733
A.

00:04:53.733 --> 00:04:54.200
Curious,

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:54.700
B.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.167
Early,

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:55.667
C.

00:04:55.667 --> 00:04:56.133
Exhausted,

00:04:56.133 --> 00:04:57.100
or D.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:57.567
Gentle?

00:04:57.567 --> 00:04:58.533
Five seconds!

00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:05.533
TIME'S UP!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:06.733
It's...

00:05:06.733 --> 00:05:07.233
C,

00:05:07.233 --> 00:05:07.767
exhausted!

00:05:07.767 --> 00:05:10.867
Climbing all day makes you very

00:05:10.867 --> 00:05:11.367
tired.

00:05:11.367 --> 00:05:15.000
Exhausted means worn out and needing rest.

00:05:16.167 --> 00:05:17.233
Here's one,

00:05:17.233 --> 00:05:18.833
a number puzzle,

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:20.400
and it's sneaky!

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:23.600
If two plus three makes eleven,

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.267
four plus one makes nine,

00:05:26.267 --> 00:05:28.900
three plus five makes twenty-three,

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.567
then two plus four makes...

00:05:31.567 --> 00:05:32.100
what?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:32.633
A.

00:05:32.633 --> 00:05:33.167
Twelve,

00:05:33.167 --> 00:05:33.667
B.

00:05:33.667 --> 00:05:34.200
Sixteen,

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:34.733
C.

00:05:34.733 --> 00:05:35.267
Fourteen,

00:05:35.267 --> 00:05:36.333
or D.

00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:36.867
Eight?

00:05:36.867 --> 00:05:37.933
Five seconds!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:44.900
TIME'S UP!

00:05:45.567 --> 00:05:46.867
The answer is...

00:05:46.867 --> 00:05:47.267
C,

00:05:47.267 --> 00:05:47.700
fourteen!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:49.433
Multiply the two numbers,

00:05:49.433 --> 00:05:51.567
then add them both back:

00:05:51.567 --> 00:05:53.700
two times four is eight,

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.300
plus two plus four is fourteen.

00:05:57.433 --> 00:05:57.833
So,

00:05:57.833 --> 00:05:59.867
are you smart or fart?

00:05:59.867 --> 00:06:02.300
Count up your correct answers to

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.500
find your rank!

00:06:04.667 --> 00:06:05.033
So,

00:06:05.033 --> 00:06:06.467
how did you do?

00:06:06.467 --> 00:06:07.933
Comment your score below,

00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:09.400
and subscribe for more!
